WEBVTT

01:35.810 --> 01:40.740
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.580 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 11]

01:49.470 --> 01:49.920
Hurry!

01:57.229 --> 01:58.150
Emperor.

02:00.480 --> 02:05.020
[Xia Jingyan, Emperor of Jinxiu]

02:09.240 --> 02:10.000
Fill it up.

02:29.570 --> 02:30.510
Everyone leave!

02:35.370 --> 02:36.829
You two, stop right there!

02:41.210 --> 02:42.340
Raise your heads.

02:47.300 --> 02:48.290
I recognize you.

02:49.000 --> 02:49.800
Last year during the Dragon Boat Festival

02:49.800 --> 02:51.240
at the ceremony by the Qingjiang River,

02:51.240 --> 02:52.540
you two were there too.

02:54.040 --> 02:55.240
One is the wife of

02:55.280 --> 02:56.270
Dai Quan, the Vice Minister of Works.

02:56.270 --> 02:56.840
The other is

02:56.840 --> 02:58.240
the niece of the Marquis of Bao'an.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.970
Why are these two here with you?

03:01.840 --> 03:02.960
Aren't you the wife of

03:02.960 --> 03:04.840
Wang Encheng,
the Vice Minister of Revenue?

03:04.840 --> 03:05.280
How did you become

03:05.280 --> 03:07.010
the Marquis of Bao'an's niece?

03:08.550 --> 03:09.950
Take them away right now!

03:10.750 --> 03:11.690
Yes, Your Majesty.

03:11.690 --> 03:12.750
Let's go. Hurry up.

03:14.340 --> 03:16.060
There're so many concubines
and beauties in the palace.

03:16.060 --> 03:17.590
Aren't they enough for your debauchery?

03:17.590 --> 03:19.630
You even have to touch
the niece of an official?

03:19.630 --> 03:21.240
How could the concubines and beauties
in the palace

03:21.240 --> 03:23.520
compare to the peerless beauties outside?

03:23.520 --> 03:24.560
But the Marquis of Bao'an's family...

03:24.560 --> 03:25.420
Mother!

03:25.590 --> 03:26.920
I didn't force them!

03:27.310 --> 03:28.570
They were all willing.

03:29.190 --> 03:30.880
Look at you now.

03:31.480 --> 03:32.780
Do you have any bearing of a ruler?

03:32.780 --> 03:34.780
I've been like this since I was a kid.

03:36.590 --> 03:38.720
Xia Jingshi has the bearing of a ruler,

03:39.030 --> 03:40.690
but do you know where he is now?

03:45.590 --> 03:47.360
I heard there's a letter from Susha.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.250
What did it say?

03:57.530 --> 03:59.660
That Feng Suige is quite interesting.

04:01.030 --> 04:02.330
He wants to keep Xia Jingshi

04:02.330 --> 04:03.990
to stay in Susha permanently,

04:04.000 --> 04:06.210
saying he loves and cherishes him

04:06.280 --> 04:08.410
even more than his own flesh and blood.

04:08.840 --> 04:11.200
This is just an excuse
to keep Xia Jingshi in Susha

04:11.200 --> 04:13.600
as a son-in-law married into their family.

04:13.680 --> 04:15.550
We absolutely cannot agree to this.

04:15.550 --> 04:16.550
I already agreed.

04:17.990 --> 04:18.839
Nonsense!

04:19.519 --> 04:21.649
How can he, a first-rank prince of Jinxiu,

04:21.649 --> 04:22.510
become a live-in son-in-law

04:22.510 --> 04:24.170
to those barbarians in Susha?

04:24.780 --> 04:26.440
If Xia Jingshi stays in Susha,

04:26.820 --> 04:28.000
wouldn't Pingling City

04:28.000 --> 04:29.630
naturally return to imperial control?

04:29.630 --> 04:31.480
Or do you think that border stronghold

04:31.480 --> 04:34.060
is better controlled
by powerful ministers, Mother?

04:34.060 --> 04:35.260
If he doesn't return,

04:35.409 --> 04:37.080
I can legitimately

04:37.110 --> 04:38.210
take back his

04:38.240 --> 04:41.080
military and political power
over the Zhennan Army.

04:41.080 --> 04:42.560
That First Prince of Susha

04:42.560 --> 04:43.890
is quite clever indeed.

04:43.960 --> 04:45.200
He could even predict

04:45.510 --> 04:47.170
that I would certainly agree.

04:47.960 --> 04:50.340
Xia Jingshi won't just sit around
and wait for his doom.

04:50.340 --> 04:52.409
How can he possibly
be trapped in Susha forever?

04:52.409 --> 04:54.610
He's bound to come back sooner or later.

04:55.080 --> 04:56.430
By the time he returns,

04:56.560 --> 04:57.750
Pingling City will

04:57.770 --> 05:00.370
no longer belong to him,
the Prince of Zhennan.

05:08.750 --> 05:09.160
Your Highness,

05:09.160 --> 05:11.020
so you had a backup plan all along.

05:11.750 --> 05:14.150
Having him marrying into our kingdom
is brilliant.

05:14.150 --> 05:16.230
Keeping Xia Jingshi in our Susha means

05:16.230 --> 05:17.920
our princess won't have to marry far away.

05:17.920 --> 05:18.680
This way,

05:19.040 --> 05:19.920
we can preserve the sibling bond

05:19.920 --> 05:21.530
between you and Her Highness,

05:21.530 --> 05:22.430
while also keeping Xia Jingshi

05:22.430 --> 05:23.880
firmly under our control.

05:23.880 --> 05:24.680
I'm afraid Xia Jingshi

05:24.680 --> 05:25.750
never expected that

05:25.750 --> 05:27.670
Your Highness would have
such a brilliant plan.

05:27.670 --> 05:29.680
Since arriving in Susha, Xia Jingshi

05:29.680 --> 05:30.820
has been acting like he has

05:30.820 --> 05:32.350
everything under control.

05:32.570 --> 05:33.510
I'm going to strip away

05:33.510 --> 05:35.240
that hypocrite's

05:35.480 --> 05:36.710
fake facade.

05:36.890 --> 05:37.690
That's right.

05:38.159 --> 05:39.800
As long as he stays in Susha,

05:40.270 --> 05:40.950
no matter what

05:40.950 --> 05:41.650
he intends to do next,

05:41.650 --> 05:42.580
it's all in vain.

05:43.240 --> 05:43.950
I'm telling you,

05:43.950 --> 05:46.110
His Highness is just one move ahead,

05:46.270 --> 05:47.040
you know?

05:47.390 --> 05:48.890
I truly admire you.

05:48.920 --> 05:50.070
I-I admire you too.

05:50.070 --> 05:51.400
Completely impressed.

05:51.600 --> 05:52.430
So you guys think

05:52.430 --> 05:53.560
victory is assured?

05:54.510 --> 05:56.710
Why don't we set up a celebration feast?

05:56.750 --> 05:57.950
That's a great idea!

05:58.070 --> 05:58.530
Well...

05:58.630 --> 05:59.159
Yun Fang and I

05:59.159 --> 06:01.620
will go prepare the wine and meat
right away.

06:04.360 --> 06:06.090
Why are you stepping on my foot?

06:08.030 --> 06:09.030
Alright, stop it.

06:09.530 --> 06:11.040
We'll have a proper celebration

06:11.040 --> 06:12.640
after we capture him.

06:13.400 --> 06:14.140
Remember,

06:14.430 --> 06:15.640
when people are backed into a corner,

06:15.640 --> 06:17.370
they'll take desperate risks.

06:17.670 --> 06:19.010
Your Highness, you mean

06:19.360 --> 06:20.270
Xia Jingshi would risk

06:20.270 --> 06:22.270
meeting with that traitor of Susha?

06:22.700 --> 06:23.500
That's right.

06:23.930 --> 06:25.730
By the time Jinxiu sends a reply,

06:25.920 --> 06:27.000
it'll be too late to change anything.

06:27.000 --> 06:27.830
Even if Xia Jingshi wants to escape,

06:27.830 --> 06:28.830
it'll be too late.

06:28.870 --> 06:30.300
And for such an important matter,

06:30.300 --> 06:30.950
he wouldn't

06:30.950 --> 06:32.390
trust his subordinates
to deliver messages.

06:32.390 --> 06:33.800
He'll have to meet in person.

06:33.800 --> 06:35.730
Keep a close eye on Zhengnian Hall.

06:37.000 --> 06:40.060
[Zhengnian Hall]

06:37.830 --> 06:38.909
By the way, Ning Fei,

06:38.909 --> 06:40.030
tell me about

06:40.250 --> 06:41.000
what happened after

06:41.000 --> 06:42.330
the Battle of Pingling.

06:44.820 --> 06:46.820
Why are you asking about this again?

06:46.830 --> 06:47.800
As for past events,

06:47.800 --> 06:48.800
I need to recall it slowly,

06:48.800 --> 06:49.680
piece by piece.

06:49.880 --> 06:51.080
Please, just help me.

06:52.510 --> 06:53.720
The cliff fall happened

06:53.720 --> 06:55.240
after the Battle of Pingling ended.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.210
I really want to know

06:56.210 --> 06:57.810
what exactly happened then.

06:57.830 --> 06:59.040
At least tell me

06:59.120 --> 07:01.580
what happened on the day
I fell off the cliff.

07:01.750 --> 07:02.350
All right.

07:08.890 --> 07:09.750
Officer Ning.

07:09.770 --> 07:11.210
Have you seen Commander Fu?

07:11.210 --> 07:12.270
Haven't seen her.

07:13.770 --> 07:14.390
Hey, guys.

07:14.800 --> 07:16.040
Have any of you seen Yixiao?

07:16.040 --> 07:16.650
No, no.

07:17.560 --> 07:18.360
Hey, fellows.

07:18.510 --> 07:19.600
Have you seen Yixiao?

07:19.600 --> 07:20.880
No, haven't seen her.

07:20.900 --> 07:21.560
We were drinking and

07:21.560 --> 07:22.630
couldn't find you anywhere.

07:22.630 --> 07:23.240
Hey, guys,

07:23.270 --> 07:24.310
have you seen Commander Fu?

07:24.310 --> 07:25.060
Commander Fu?

07:25.060 --> 07:26.160
I think she went toward

07:26.160 --> 07:27.040
His Highness's military tent.

07:27.040 --> 07:27.560
Okay.

07:27.900 --> 07:28.630
Don't worry.

07:28.830 --> 07:30.030
Come on, let's drink!

07:30.190 --> 07:30.600
Someone said

07:30.600 --> 07:32.360
you went toward
His Highness's military tent.

07:32.360 --> 07:33.190
Weiran and I thought

07:33.190 --> 07:34.730
you must have had something to discuss
with His Highness,

07:34.730 --> 07:36.260
so we didn't go look for you.

07:36.520 --> 07:37.650
What happened next?

07:41.810 --> 07:42.340
Next...

07:43.240 --> 07:44.450
After that, we drank too much

07:44.450 --> 07:46.110
and returned to our own tents.

07:46.830 --> 07:47.750
When I sobered up,

07:47.750 --> 07:49.409
you had already disappeared.

07:49.710 --> 07:51.310
Why are you being so evasive?

07:52.430 --> 07:53.920
That night I got excited from drinking

07:53.920 --> 07:55.430
and got into a fight with someone.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.750
Weiran helped settle the matter

07:56.750 --> 07:58.150
and forced me to go to bed.

07:59.200 --> 08:00.110
Ning Fei,

08:00.400 --> 08:01.960
you're my best friend.

08:02.090 --> 08:03.740
I don't remember anything now.

08:03.740 --> 08:05.140
You mustn't lie to me.

08:06.430 --> 08:07.190
When have I, Ning Fei,

08:07.190 --> 08:08.120
ever lied to you?

08:08.190 --> 08:08.680
Yixiao,

08:08.960 --> 08:09.920
even if you don't remember,

08:09.920 --> 08:11.180
you can't distrust me.

08:14.070 --> 08:14.610
Look,

08:14.680 --> 08:15.400
I swear,

08:15.560 --> 08:16.630
if I speak even one word of lie,

08:16.630 --> 08:18.290
may lightning strike me down!

08:18.700 --> 08:19.400
Stop it.

08:21.470 --> 08:22.670
Do you believe me now?

08:31.320 --> 08:31.940
[You, Xiao Weiran and Ning Fei
are all orphans.]

08:31.970 --> 08:32.780
[The three of you grew up together.]

08:36.240 --> 08:37.150
Do you think what Ning Fei said

08:37.150 --> 08:38.020
is true?

08:39.440 --> 08:40.669
Judging by his demeanor,

08:40.669 --> 08:42.130
he was probably not lying.

08:42.270 --> 08:43.870
But I still need to verify it.

08:44.390 --> 08:46.080
Xia Jingshi is almost recovered

08:46.080 --> 08:47.910
and should return to the inn soon.

08:47.910 --> 08:49.320
What do you plan to do next?

08:49.320 --> 08:50.850
Are you going to ask him directly?

08:50.850 --> 08:52.220
Feng Suige told me

08:52.630 --> 08:54.280
that memories recalled with others' help

08:54.280 --> 08:55.280
may not be true.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.670
Only what I remember by myself

08:56.670 --> 08:57.870
cannot be falsified.

08:57.960 --> 08:58.880
Even if

08:58.910 --> 08:59.510
I put a knife

08:59.510 --> 09:01.110
to Xia Jingshi's throat now,

09:01.250 --> 09:03.030
he might still not tell the truth.

09:03.030 --> 09:05.030
So you plan to continue pretending?

09:06.960 --> 09:08.220
I need to make him believe

09:08.220 --> 09:09.240
that I've completely returned

09:09.240 --> 09:10.010
to being that Fu Yixiao

09:10.010 --> 09:11.360
who was completely obedient

09:11.360 --> 09:12.670
and loyal to him.

09:13.200 --> 09:14.830
But since he intends to harm you,

09:14.830 --> 09:15.750
he must have prepared

09:15.750 --> 09:16.750
all kinds of lies.

09:16.910 --> 09:18.390
How do you plan to test him?

09:19.870 --> 09:20.600
Don't worry.

09:20.980 --> 09:22.150
Even a goose leaves a trace
when it files by.

09:22.150 --> 09:23.280
There will be flaws.

09:24.080 --> 09:24.960
It's just that

09:24.960 --> 09:26.630
every single moment spent with him

09:26.630 --> 09:28.230
feels painful and repulsive

09:28.600 --> 09:29.390
to me.

09:32.520 --> 09:33.850
What about Ning Fei

09:33.910 --> 09:35.150
and Xiao Weiran?

09:35.270 --> 09:36.630
Could they be part of Xia Jingshi's...

09:36.630 --> 09:37.240
If those two

09:37.240 --> 09:38.720
were also involved in
the attempt to kill me,

09:38.720 --> 09:40.520
I absolutely won't let them off.

09:41.930 --> 09:43.240
But I'm not sure yet.

09:44.390 --> 09:45.740
That fool Ning Fei.

09:45.840 --> 09:47.310
His feelings are written
all over his face.

09:47.310 --> 09:49.840
What evil intentions
could he possibly have?

10:00.030 --> 10:00.790
Prime Minister.

10:00.790 --> 10:01.720
Minister Shen has arrived.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.050
Prime Minister Zhuang.

10:13.790 --> 10:15.640
What does His Majesty think?

10:16.960 --> 10:18.000
His Majesty kept

10:18.000 --> 10:19.730
the First Prince behind alone.

10:20.960 --> 10:21.710
I think

10:22.510 --> 10:24.520
His Majesty just wants to discipline

10:24.520 --> 10:25.680
his son in private.

10:25.720 --> 10:27.120
It also spares

10:27.150 --> 10:28.630
the First Prince some face.

10:28.630 --> 10:30.500
It's good, actually. Let His Majesty

10:30.500 --> 10:32.550
give the First Prince a proper scolding,

10:32.550 --> 10:33.410
so that brat won't

10:33.410 --> 10:34.740
get more foolish ideas.

10:40.510 --> 10:41.510
I didn't mean to say "that brat."

10:41.510 --> 10:42.120
I meant,

10:42.790 --> 10:44.120
His Highness the First Prince.

10:44.120 --> 10:45.680
I misspoke.

10:45.960 --> 10:46.420
I'll...

10:46.420 --> 10:48.030
Slap myself.

10:48.830 --> 10:51.030
You don't even know what you said wrong.

10:51.200 --> 10:51.910
Let me tell you.

10:51.910 --> 10:53.260
His Majesty will agree.

10:53.800 --> 10:55.180
Agree to what?

10:56.690 --> 10:57.790
I know.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.910
His Majesty must have agreed to support me

11:01.910 --> 11:04.080
and make the First Prince

11:04.150 --> 11:05.550
hand over that Fu Yixiao.

11:09.790 --> 11:12.120
Thank you, Your Majesty!

11:14.910 --> 11:18.320
His Majesty will surely agree to
the marriage into the family.

11:18.320 --> 11:20.140
From what I know of His Majesty,

11:20.480 --> 11:22.080
the First Prince's proposal

11:22.360 --> 11:24.290
aligns perfectly with his wishes.

11:24.760 --> 11:25.890
He won't decline it.

11:26.380 --> 11:27.250
So you mean

11:27.270 --> 11:30.640
the Prince of Zhennan will really
marry into our imperial family?

11:30.640 --> 11:32.840
It still depends on Jinxiu's response.

11:33.150 --> 11:34.680
This marriage arrangement

11:35.100 --> 11:36.700
isn't up to the First Prince.

11:36.840 --> 11:38.390
Whether the Prince of Zhennan is willing

11:38.390 --> 11:39.550
doesn't matter either.

11:39.550 --> 11:41.270
Only His Majesty

11:41.320 --> 11:43.000
and the Emperor of Jinxiu's attitudes

11:43.000 --> 11:44.600
will determine the outcome.

11:44.920 --> 11:45.570
However,

11:46.270 --> 11:47.600
the First Prince took it upon himself

11:47.600 --> 11:49.460
to write to the Emperor of Jinxiu.

11:49.960 --> 11:52.200
This matter can be made into
a serious issue.

11:52.200 --> 11:53.840
Do you understand what I mean?

11:53.840 --> 11:55.890
So Xia Jingshi's

11:56.000 --> 11:57.930
future child with Princess Xiyang

11:58.000 --> 11:59.200
will not bear the surname Xia,

11:59.200 --> 12:01.200
but will take the surname Feng instead.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.860
Do you understand what I said?

12:03.770 --> 12:04.860
I understand.

12:05.120 --> 12:06.030
I understand completely.

12:06.030 --> 12:08.520
I'll contact my colleagues right away.

12:08.750 --> 12:11.120
We'll make sure to submit a harsh memorial

12:11.360 --> 12:13.360
against the First Prince tomorrow.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.440
Your Highness,

12:18.440 --> 12:19.500
news just arrived:

12:19.670 --> 12:20.840
our wedding procession

12:20.840 --> 12:22.320
has reached the Susha border.

12:22.320 --> 12:24.650
They will arrive in Yujing City tomorrow.

12:25.310 --> 12:27.120
Using the wedding procession
as an opportunity,

12:27.120 --> 12:29.440
we can urge Susha
to exchange prisoners soon.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.080
This way, we can also take

12:30.080 --> 12:31.960
Yixiao away from here as soon as possible.

12:31.960 --> 12:33.160
Feng Suige is someone

12:33.200 --> 12:34.310
who's hard to read.

12:34.680 --> 12:36.340
I'm afraid if we stay too long,

12:36.440 --> 12:38.270
something unexpected might happen.

12:38.270 --> 12:39.000
Understood.

12:39.900 --> 12:41.310
You've been in Yujing for many days now.

12:41.310 --> 12:42.240
Have you secretly observed

12:42.240 --> 12:43.440
the market of Yujing?

12:43.630 --> 12:44.870
Thriving businesses,

12:44.870 --> 12:45.910
shops everywhere,

12:45.910 --> 12:47.110
with abundant goods.

12:47.390 --> 12:50.190
The Susha Kingdom is much stronger
than I thought.

12:53.790 --> 12:55.670
I've been stationed in
the southern frontier for over 10 years,

12:55.670 --> 12:57.200
fought seven major battles

12:57.320 --> 12:59.980
and countless minor skirmishes
against Susha.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.080
Of the southern frontier's annual taxes,

13:01.080 --> 13:02.810
70% goes to military expenses.

13:03.320 --> 13:04.750
Pingling City, with its modest population
and small garrison,

13:04.750 --> 13:06.670
is nothing compared to
the splendor of Yujing.

13:06.670 --> 13:07.510
Though they were defeated

13:07.510 --> 13:08.970
in the Battle of Pingling,

13:09.120 --> 13:10.490
for Susha, it was merely

13:10.670 --> 13:12.070
a minor irritation

13:12.180 --> 13:13.710
that caused no real damage.

13:13.920 --> 13:14.870
Feng Pingcheng

13:15.920 --> 13:17.790
is a great ruler of his generation.

13:17.790 --> 13:18.650
Your Highness.

13:18.730 --> 13:19.580
In my opinion,

13:20.030 --> 13:21.170
Feng Suige is actually

13:21.170 --> 13:22.270
not at all like

13:22.320 --> 13:23.510
what others describe him to be,

13:23.510 --> 13:25.330
just a bloodthirsty warrior.

13:25.790 --> 13:26.720
On the contrary,

13:26.840 --> 13:28.750
he's impossible to read or figure out.

13:28.750 --> 13:29.360
In fact,

13:29.630 --> 13:31.600
he's more difficult to deal with
than Feng Pingcheng.

13:31.600 --> 13:32.270
Therefore,

13:32.930 --> 13:34.550
Feng Suige absolutely cannot become

13:34.550 --> 13:36.010
the future ruler of Susha.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.700
If he takes the throne,

13:37.790 --> 13:38.440
our Jinxiu

13:38.460 --> 13:40.190
will have no chance of victory.

13:50.590 --> 13:52.200
Your Highness, are you feeling better?

13:52.200 --> 13:52.930
Much better.

13:54.270 --> 13:55.360
Then please drink this bowl of medicine

13:55.360 --> 13:56.620
while it's still warm.

13:56.840 --> 13:58.630
This medicine was personally prepared
by Xueying.

13:58.630 --> 13:59.270
It can help relieve your pain

13:59.270 --> 14:00.730
when the poison flares up.

14:00.790 --> 14:01.570
Ning Fei also

14:01.670 --> 14:03.480
personally brewed it by the stove.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.680
Thank you, Miss Ling.

14:05.510 --> 14:06.370
Your Highness.

14:09.510 --> 14:11.120
Tomorrow, our wedding procession

14:11.120 --> 14:11.750
will arrive.

14:11.750 --> 14:12.360
By then,

14:12.380 --> 14:14.230
your antidote will also be delivered.

14:14.230 --> 14:16.150
In my opinion, perhaps we should wait

14:16.150 --> 14:17.630
and not take any other medicine for now

14:17.630 --> 14:19.760
to avoid conflicts with the antidote.

14:26.480 --> 14:27.780
I've already tested it.

14:27.780 --> 14:30.180
The temperature is just right,
not too hot.

14:40.280 --> 14:42.200
Ning Fei says you never eat breakfast,

14:42.200 --> 14:43.240
but Xueying says

14:43.270 --> 14:44.120
your body is weakened by the poison

14:44.120 --> 14:45.510
and you should eat more nourishing food.

14:45.510 --> 14:46.720
So should I listen to Ning Fei

14:46.720 --> 14:47.770
or to Xueying?

14:49.550 --> 14:50.610
I'll listen to you.

14:51.180 --> 14:52.510
I'll make the call then.

14:52.630 --> 14:53.960
I'll have breakfast prepared.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.420
See you in the dining hall.

15:06.960 --> 15:07.630
Your Highness.

15:07.630 --> 15:08.240
Don't you think...

15:08.240 --> 15:08.700
Enough.

15:09.120 --> 15:10.750
The prescription was written by Miss Ling,

15:10.750 --> 15:11.620
and the medicine was prepared by Ning Fei.

15:11.620 --> 15:12.790
Yixiao just brought it here.

15:12.790 --> 15:13.920
What could be wrong?

15:14.480 --> 15:15.200
I've already failed

15:15.200 --> 15:16.330
Yixiao once before.

15:17.270 --> 15:18.240
Now I'm about to marry

15:18.240 --> 15:19.270
the Princess of Susha.

15:19.270 --> 15:20.870
It will break her heart again.

15:20.870 --> 15:21.960
The fact that she can put aside
past grievances

15:21.960 --> 15:24.420
and return to my side
is already remarkable.

15:25.440 --> 15:26.700
So don't overthink it.

15:28.270 --> 15:28.790
Yes.

15:36.720 --> 15:37.240
Yixiao.

15:38.480 --> 15:39.240
I don't remember what

15:39.240 --> 15:40.510
Your Highness likes to eat.

15:40.510 --> 15:41.150
These are all

15:41.150 --> 15:42.510
what Shunzi and others enjoy eating.

15:42.510 --> 15:43.120
I suppose

15:43.320 --> 15:45.520
they suit the taste of us Jinxiu people.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.650
These are all my favorites.

15:52.180 --> 15:53.260
Before,

15:53.320 --> 15:54.120
did we also dine

15:54.120 --> 15:55.780
together with Your Highness?

15:57.510 --> 15:57.970
Yixiao,

15:58.630 --> 15:59.460
between us,

15:59.600 --> 16:01.600
we never cared about rank or status.

16:01.670 --> 16:02.330
Please sit.

16:04.270 --> 16:04.960
Yixiao,

16:05.450 --> 16:06.270
do you remember

16:06.270 --> 16:07.200
the first time His Highness

16:07.200 --> 16:07.790
hit you?

16:10.790 --> 16:11.920
His Highness hit me?

16:13.150 --> 16:15.270
You've always been one to hold grudges.

16:15.270 --> 16:17.600
You mentioned it quite often afterwards.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.880
I don't remember at all.

16:20.910 --> 16:21.390
Yixiao,

16:22.080 --> 16:23.340
Weiran is just joking.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.520
At that time,

16:24.720 --> 16:26.240
you had just joined the Zhennan Army,

16:26.240 --> 16:28.080
and you didn't know my temperament yet.

16:28.080 --> 16:29.430
Once, I took you out,

16:29.720 --> 16:30.390
and there was a shop

16:30.390 --> 16:32.080
displaying all kinds of earrings.

16:32.080 --> 16:33.550
You kept staring at those earrings.

16:33.550 --> 16:34.320
So I asked you

16:34.480 --> 16:35.360
if you liked them

16:35.360 --> 16:36.290
and wanted them.

16:56.510 --> 16:58.240
Interested in these earrings?

17:01.000 --> 17:02.470
In the death camp,

17:02.530 --> 17:04.640
the instructor said
I was a lower-class person.

17:04.640 --> 17:05.770
He told me to always remember

17:05.770 --> 17:07.099
my lower-class status.

17:07.400 --> 17:08.800
I shouldn't dare to dream

17:09.640 --> 17:10.349
of possessing things

17:10.349 --> 17:11.950
that shouldn't belong to me.

17:13.720 --> 17:15.319
Whether commoner or prince,

17:15.750 --> 17:17.280
since we're all born human,

17:17.510 --> 17:18.369
you should know

17:18.400 --> 17:19.859
the value of your own life.

17:20.109 --> 17:21.640
What does it matter if our origins differ?

17:21.640 --> 17:23.369
Aren't we all ordinary people?

17:23.380 --> 17:24.960
Don't we all experience
birth, aging, sickness, death,

17:24.960 --> 17:26.589
joy, anger, sorrow, and happiness?

17:26.589 --> 17:27.400
How can you say

17:27.400 --> 17:28.830
you're a lower-class person?

17:28.830 --> 17:29.490
From now on,

17:30.000 --> 17:30.920
if anyone dares to say

17:30.920 --> 17:31.880
such things to your face,

17:31.880 --> 17:34.010
just take this whip and lash them good.

17:35.180 --> 17:36.710
This is my imperial decree.

17:37.200 --> 17:38.260
Do you understand?

17:39.840 --> 17:40.640
I understand.

17:41.690 --> 17:42.620
Don't be afraid.

17:43.470 --> 17:45.730
Even if one day
you punch a hole in the sky,

17:46.350 --> 17:47.950
I'll always be your support.

17:52.110 --> 17:52.640
Go ahead,

17:52.750 --> 17:54.210
pick a few things you like.

18:04.030 --> 18:05.030
And then I struck you once

18:05.030 --> 18:06.030
with my horsewhip

18:06.450 --> 18:07.690
because I wanted you to remember...

18:07.690 --> 18:08.950
You want me to remember

18:09.400 --> 18:11.530
that I'm not some lower-class person.

18:17.870 --> 18:19.050
Now that Your Highness mentioned it,

18:19.050 --> 18:20.110
I remember now.

18:26.070 --> 18:27.530
What else do you remember?

18:29.440 --> 18:30.530
Xueying said

18:30.590 --> 18:31.350
my memory only comes back

18:31.350 --> 18:32.610
with help from others.

18:32.860 --> 18:34.460
If I rely entirely on myself,

18:34.480 --> 18:36.880
I won't be able to remember anything
at all.

18:39.350 --> 18:40.210
Your Highness.

18:40.340 --> 18:41.860
Why don't you tell me about

18:42.000 --> 18:44.460
what happened
after the Battle of Pingling?

18:49.130 --> 18:50.390
Your Highness, let me.

18:51.570 --> 18:52.360
That day,

18:52.380 --> 18:54.240
you shot Feng Suige with an arrow,

18:54.350 --> 18:55.510
and our army won a great victory.

18:55.510 --> 18:57.640
That night, you were discussing with me

18:57.640 --> 18:58.440
how your arrow

18:58.660 --> 18:59.650
missed by just a hair

18:59.650 --> 19:01.590
and didn't hit him right in the chest.

19:01.590 --> 19:02.170
You were

19:02.290 --> 19:03.550
so regretful about it.

19:03.590 --> 19:04.050
We were drinking,

19:04.050 --> 19:05.510
but we couldn't find you anywhere.

19:05.510 --> 19:06.030
Someone said you

19:06.030 --> 19:07.680
went toward His Highness's tent.

19:07.680 --> 19:08.400
Weiran and I

19:08.480 --> 19:09.310
thought you and Your Highness

19:09.310 --> 19:10.110
had something to discuss,

19:10.110 --> 19:11.640
so we didn't go look for you.

19:13.680 --> 19:14.640
He's lying.

19:15.750 --> 19:16.960
Why would he lie?

19:21.750 --> 19:22.950
When we were arguing,

19:23.340 --> 19:24.870
was His Highness there too?

19:25.930 --> 19:26.860
Of course he was.

19:27.510 --> 19:29.050
That day, you were drunk and

19:29.230 --> 19:30.000
insisted on pursuing

19:30.000 --> 19:31.200
Feng Suige's troops.

19:31.550 --> 19:32.550
His Highness advised you

19:32.550 --> 19:33.870
not to pursue a fleeing enemy.

19:33.870 --> 19:35.200
But you wouldn't listen.

19:35.200 --> 19:37.120
You said the chance to kill Feng Suige

19:37.120 --> 19:38.320
was once in a lifetime

19:38.350 --> 19:39.680
and couldn't be missed.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.590
You knew I was drunk,

19:41.610 --> 19:43.010
so why didn't you stop me?

19:43.440 --> 19:45.100
Of course we tried to stop you.

19:45.490 --> 19:46.950
But you promised us

19:47.310 --> 19:48.710
you wouldn't act rashly.

19:48.940 --> 19:49.680
But later,

19:49.770 --> 19:51.510
you left the camp without telling us

19:51.510 --> 19:53.510
and went after Feng Suige all alone.

19:53.550 --> 19:55.080
About what happened after that,

19:55.080 --> 19:56.010
nobody knows.

19:57.050 --> 19:58.110
Ning Fei mentioned

19:58.440 --> 19:59.290
that some soldiers

19:59.290 --> 20:01.240
saw me fall off the cliff by accident?

20:01.240 --> 20:02.040
That's right.

20:02.510 --> 20:03.590
We all thought

20:03.640 --> 20:05.150
you had accidentally fallen off the cliff.

20:05.150 --> 20:06.480
But only after seeing you again this time
did we learn

20:06.480 --> 20:08.410
that you were also shot by an arrow.

20:09.020 --> 20:10.220
Yixiao, don't worry.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.090
As soon as you remember

20:12.090 --> 20:13.350
what happened that day

20:13.510 --> 20:15.240
and who shot you with that arrow,

20:15.240 --> 20:17.100
we won't let them get away with it.

20:18.600 --> 20:19.290
Of course.

20:19.680 --> 20:20.790
If I find this person,

20:20.790 --> 20:22.750
I definitely won't spare them either.

20:22.750 --> 20:23.560
Your Highness,

20:23.560 --> 20:24.490
don't you agree?

20:30.750 --> 20:31.410
Certainly.

20:32.580 --> 20:34.830
Let's eat first. The food is getting cold.

20:34.830 --> 20:36.680
His Highness still needs to return to
the inn today

20:36.680 --> 20:38.240
to handle some
important official business.

20:38.240 --> 20:39.440
What's so important?

20:39.720 --> 20:41.340
Official business is never-ending.

20:41.340 --> 20:41.960
It's nothing but

20:41.960 --> 20:43.440
some trivial matters
about the marriage alliance.

20:43.440 --> 20:44.790
What's so urgent about that?

20:44.790 --> 20:45.460
His Highness's health

20:45.460 --> 20:46.660
is what matters most.

20:47.310 --> 20:48.110
Your Highness,

20:48.110 --> 20:49.370
please eat well first.

20:49.830 --> 20:50.530
I'll have Xueying

20:50.530 --> 20:51.830
prepare some medicinal food

20:51.830 --> 20:53.760
to help you recover your strength.

20:53.920 --> 20:54.440
Okay.

21:04.790 --> 21:06.450
Why did you lie to her just now?

21:06.750 --> 21:07.810
I needed to confirm

21:07.830 --> 21:09.690
how much she actually remembers.

21:09.990 --> 21:10.760
Now it seems

21:11.440 --> 21:13.440
she truly doesn't remember anything.

21:13.440 --> 21:15.100
How many times have I asked you

21:15.160 --> 21:16.760
to stop being so suspicious?

21:18.060 --> 21:19.040
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

21:19.040 --> 21:20.240
This is the last time.

21:20.480 --> 21:22.680
Once confirmed, I won't worry anymore.

21:23.010 --> 21:25.240
From now on, Your Highness
can interact with Yixiao

21:25.240 --> 21:26.770
more naturally and at ease.

21:54.070 --> 21:54.750
Your Highness is already

21:54.750 --> 21:55.960
breathtakingly beautiful.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.050
With these earrings,

21:57.050 --> 21:58.380
it's truly perfection.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.370
I remember

21:59.400 --> 22:00.790
last year, Father gave me a pair of

22:00.790 --> 22:01.850
white jade earrings.

22:01.850 --> 22:03.010
Where are they?

22:03.350 --> 22:05.720
You want to wear the white jade earrings,
Your Highness?

22:05.720 --> 22:06.270
But these ones

22:06.270 --> 22:07.870
were sent by Empress Zhuang.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.090
They're priceless

22:09.160 --> 22:11.240
and better match your wedding attire.

22:11.240 --> 22:12.300
On my wedding day,

22:12.350 --> 22:14.550
I want to wear the ones Father bestowed.

22:14.920 --> 22:15.590
It's not about

22:15.590 --> 22:16.910
how valuable they are,

22:17.240 --> 22:17.830
but about

22:17.830 --> 22:19.640
Father's sentiment behind them.

22:19.640 --> 22:21.480
That's what makes them truly precious.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.520
Your Highness is right.

22:22.520 --> 22:24.050
I'll go get them right away.

22:40.440 --> 22:42.110
Your Highness, I found them.

23:03.310 --> 23:03.840
Sister.

23:04.510 --> 23:05.240
How did it go?

23:07.010 --> 23:07.830
What Xiao Weiran and Ning Fei said

23:07.830 --> 23:08.690
doesn't match.

23:09.190 --> 23:10.240
One of them

23:10.490 --> 23:11.660
is lying.

23:12.770 --> 23:13.970
Who do you think it is?

23:17.940 --> 23:19.400
I'll go ask Ning Fei again.

23:19.750 --> 23:20.390
Okay.

23:33.830 --> 23:34.420
Ning Fei.

23:36.310 --> 23:36.860
Yixiao.

23:37.330 --> 23:38.720
How's His Highness doing?

23:38.720 --> 23:39.600
Don't worry.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.270
His Highness took Xueying's medicine

23:41.270 --> 23:42.310
and is much better now.

23:42.310 --> 23:43.040
That's good.

23:44.070 --> 23:45.130
You must be hungry.

23:45.510 --> 23:47.240
Xueying prepared this for you.

23:47.270 --> 23:48.640
I don't know if you'll like it.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.750
From now on, whatever you want to eat,

23:49.750 --> 23:51.680
just ask Xueying to make it for you.

23:52.270 --> 23:54.240
Later,
when the wedding procession arrives,

23:54.240 --> 23:55.510
we should select some generous gifts

23:55.510 --> 23:57.110
to properly thank Miss Ling.

23:58.830 --> 23:59.560
This is good.

24:00.640 --> 24:01.770
By the way, Ning Fei.

24:02.110 --> 24:04.050
There's something I want to ask you.

24:04.050 --> 24:05.310
Please help me recall—

24:06.000 --> 24:07.480
did anything special happen

24:07.480 --> 24:09.270
on the night of the Battle of Pingling?

24:09.270 --> 24:10.360
Anything special?

24:10.720 --> 24:11.240
I really

24:11.240 --> 24:12.720
can't remember anything at all,

24:12.720 --> 24:14.030
so please help me jog my memory.

24:14.030 --> 24:15.030
If you tell me more,

24:15.030 --> 24:15.680
perhaps I might

24:15.680 --> 24:16.880
remember something.

24:16.960 --> 24:18.180
For example,

24:18.790 --> 24:19.720
was there anyone

24:19.750 --> 24:21.550
who saw His Highness in the camp?

24:24.750 --> 24:25.830
But since you ask,

24:25.850 --> 24:27.160
I do remember something.

24:27.160 --> 24:28.030
That night,

24:28.400 --> 24:30.130
there was a merchant who visited the camp,

24:30.130 --> 24:32.390
and I believe he went to see His Highness.

24:33.870 --> 24:34.920
What merchant?

24:37.120 --> 24:39.600
He said he was trading medicinal herbs.

24:40.070 --> 24:40.870
That's right.

24:41.480 --> 24:43.130
For something as trivial as trading herbs,

24:43.130 --> 24:44.960
why would His Highness need to
handle it personally?

24:44.960 --> 24:46.790
Couldn't Weiran have taken care of it?

24:46.790 --> 24:47.740
I remember

24:48.160 --> 24:48.960
that merchant's carriage

24:48.960 --> 24:50.290
looked quite luxurious.

24:50.290 --> 24:51.830
His status must have been significant.

24:51.830 --> 24:53.830
I didn't think much about it though.

24:56.000 --> 24:57.530
Ning Fei, come have a drink!

24:57.630 --> 24:58.230
Coming!

24:59.960 --> 25:01.490
How many people were there?

25:01.790 --> 25:03.450
I remember there was just one.

25:03.460 --> 25:04.790
I never saw them anyway.

25:05.920 --> 25:06.720
What's wrong?

25:08.160 --> 25:09.270
Are you thinking...

25:09.270 --> 25:10.800
I'm not thinking anything.

25:11.070 --> 25:12.070
I just hope you can

25:12.070 --> 25:13.520
tell me more details

25:13.790 --> 25:15.850
so I can remember everything sooner.

25:17.180 --> 25:18.240
I really want to return to

25:18.240 --> 25:19.270
being the old Yixiao,

25:19.270 --> 25:20.810
able to help you and His Highness more.

25:20.810 --> 25:22.140
Wouldn't that be great?

25:22.820 --> 25:23.750
I thought there was something wrong

25:23.750 --> 25:24.880
with that merchant.

25:25.100 --> 25:26.570
What could be wrong with a merchant?

25:26.570 --> 25:27.670
I was just asking.

25:28.550 --> 25:29.210
By the way,

25:29.350 --> 25:31.020
don't tell anyone about this,

25:31.330 --> 25:33.200
especially His Highness and Weiran.

25:33.200 --> 25:35.130
I don't want them to worry about me.

25:35.530 --> 25:36.230
Got it.

25:44.110 --> 25:45.070
Why would Xiao Weiran

25:45.070 --> 25:46.440
help Xia Jingshi lie?

25:47.260 --> 25:48.660
Could he be involved too?

25:49.430 --> 25:51.020
Were the assassins
at the bottom of the cliff

25:51.020 --> 25:52.290
sent by him?

25:53.640 --> 25:55.300
Who was that merchant really?

25:55.590 --> 25:56.550
What were he and Xia Jingshi

25:56.550 --> 25:57.680
plotting together?

25:59.140 --> 26:00.070
Whatever it was,

26:00.960 --> 26:01.590
perhaps

26:02.160 --> 26:03.270
that was the real reason why

26:03.270 --> 26:04.270
Xia Jingshi shot me with an arrow

26:04.270 --> 26:06.130
and sent me falling off the cliff.

26:19.100 --> 26:20.430
Were you waiting for me?

26:20.580 --> 26:21.770
Since we met,

26:22.060 --> 26:24.390
we've never had time to be alone together.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.200
There are some things I don't know

26:25.200 --> 26:26.730
whether I should say or not.

26:27.960 --> 26:28.580
Go ahead.

26:29.190 --> 26:30.390
We're not strangers.

26:30.750 --> 26:31.680
I want to ask you,

26:32.200 --> 26:33.840
what do you think about
the marriage alliance

26:33.840 --> 26:35.840
between His Highness and Susha's Princess?

26:35.840 --> 26:37.220
Does what I think

26:37.440 --> 26:38.240
matter?

26:41.410 --> 26:42.170
I see.

26:42.930 --> 26:44.090
You must know

26:44.560 --> 26:46.760
His Highness once promised to marry me.

26:47.550 --> 26:48.350
That's right.

26:49.440 --> 26:51.590
There are things His Highness cannot ask

26:51.590 --> 26:52.340
or say,

26:52.590 --> 26:53.030
but I

26:53.030 --> 26:54.490
have to be the bad guy here.

26:54.920 --> 26:55.590
Although right now

26:55.590 --> 26:57.250
you can't remember anything,

26:57.750 --> 26:58.610
someday

26:59.240 --> 27:00.900
you'll remember everything.

27:01.550 --> 27:03.030
Since I lost my memory,

27:03.240 --> 27:04.440
I've met many people.

27:05.110 --> 27:06.270
Whether it's Xueying,

27:06.270 --> 27:07.300
Feng Suige,

27:07.790 --> 27:08.760
His Highness,

27:09.140 --> 27:10.590
or even myself,

27:11.440 --> 27:12.440
we've always been

27:12.680 --> 27:13.790
looking at things

27:13.830 --> 27:15.230
from our own perspective.

27:15.230 --> 27:16.370
It seems only you

27:16.830 --> 27:17.510
completely consider things

27:17.510 --> 27:19.440
from His Highness's perspective.

27:20.320 --> 27:21.250
I'm simply doing

27:21.640 --> 27:22.900
my duty in my position.

27:23.670 --> 27:24.660
If you were me,

27:24.920 --> 27:26.110
from my perspective,

27:26.110 --> 27:27.440
what would you think about

27:27.440 --> 27:28.840
this marriage alliance?

27:29.400 --> 27:31.060
Rather than being entangled,

27:31.180 --> 27:32.830
it's better to forget each other.

27:32.830 --> 27:33.270
If I say

27:33.270 --> 27:35.490
I never had any intention of entanglement,

27:35.490 --> 27:36.690
would you believe me?

27:37.200 --> 27:38.020
Rest assured.

27:38.270 --> 27:39.200
Even if someday

27:39.200 --> 27:40.720
I remember everything,

27:41.510 --> 27:42.770
I will absolutely not have

27:42.770 --> 27:44.830
any entanglement with His Highness.

27:44.900 --> 27:46.480
There's a type of person in this world

27:46.480 --> 27:47.110
who's naturally

27:47.110 --> 27:48.910
as radiant as stars and the moon.

27:49.440 --> 27:50.400
But loving such a person

27:50.400 --> 27:51.260
is too painful.

27:51.740 --> 27:52.890
I'm a lazy person,

27:53.550 --> 27:55.810
too lazy to bring suffering upon myself.

27:57.430 --> 27:59.270
It's good that you're willing to let go.

27:59.270 --> 28:00.490
I'm quite curious—

28:01.550 --> 28:02.900
are you more concerned that

28:02.900 --> 28:04.510
I might entangle myself with His Highness,

28:04.510 --> 28:05.500
or that I might end up

28:05.500 --> 28:06.880
in pain in the future?

28:17.680 --> 28:18.310
I get it.

28:19.650 --> 28:21.380
Actually, you care about both.

28:34.680 --> 28:36.480
Stop frowning all the time.

28:37.990 --> 28:39.190
Everything will pass

28:39.880 --> 28:40.840
eventually.

28:49.570 --> 28:50.670
Nine.

29:00.600 --> 29:02.570
Your Highness, I've missed you so much!

29:02.570 --> 29:03.880
I've missed you too!

29:03.920 --> 29:05.920
I've missed you too, Your Highness.

29:05.920 --> 29:07.920
I think about you all every day, too.

29:08.210 --> 29:09.230
After a while,

29:09.250 --> 29:10.610
let's go home together with Master,

29:10.610 --> 29:11.210
alright?

29:11.830 --> 29:12.350
Sure.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.110
Xia Jingshi.

29:24.170 --> 29:26.100
Why exactly did you want to kill me?

29:27.000 --> 29:27.530
Alright,

29:27.530 --> 29:28.720
go play over there for a while.

29:28.720 --> 29:29.200
Okay.

29:29.270 --> 29:29.750
Okay.

29:30.400 --> 29:30.930
Let's go.

29:59.510 --> 30:01.370
Xueying asked me to give you this.

30:10.680 --> 30:11.270
Miss Ling didn't ask you

30:11.270 --> 30:12.160
to give me this.

30:12.890 --> 30:14.330
You made this yourself.

30:15.550 --> 30:16.230
You've read the book

30:16.230 --> 30:17.830
I gave you carefully, right?

30:18.110 --> 30:20.310
Before, whenever the poison flared up,

30:20.620 --> 30:21.880
even after taking the antidote,

30:21.880 --> 30:22.790
I would still feel pain

30:22.790 --> 30:24.550
throughout my body for the first two days.

30:24.550 --> 30:26.310
The military doctor said I should carry

30:26.310 --> 30:28.070
this kind of herbal sachet with me.

30:28.070 --> 30:30.330
The herbal scent helps relieve the pain.

30:30.720 --> 30:31.310
Later,

30:31.830 --> 30:33.360
before each poison attack,

30:33.570 --> 30:35.430
you always prepared these for me.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.060
Your Highness.

30:39.720 --> 30:40.710
To be honest,

30:40.950 --> 30:42.390
I once suspected

30:42.720 --> 30:45.120
maybe you were the one
who wanted to kill me.

31:07.550 --> 31:09.160
When you first came to Susha to see me,

31:09.160 --> 31:10.980
I deliberately kept my distance from you.

31:10.980 --> 31:12.650
It was because Xueying told me

31:13.000 --> 31:13.770
that the person who wanted to kill me

31:13.770 --> 31:16.070
must have been someone
closest and most familiar to me.

31:16.070 --> 31:16.720
Others wouldn't have had the opportunity

31:16.720 --> 31:17.960
to shoot me down with an arrow

31:17.960 --> 31:19.040
at such a close range.

31:19.040 --> 31:20.190
Only after reading the book you gave me

31:20.190 --> 31:21.630
in the last few days

31:21.890 --> 31:23.090
did I understand that

31:23.410 --> 31:24.670
you were the last person

31:24.670 --> 31:26.930
I should have suspected, Your Highness.

31:52.920 --> 31:53.820
It's all right.

31:54.000 --> 31:54.700
I know

31:54.880 --> 31:56.490
that you don't understand me now.

31:56.490 --> 31:57.830
You will understand in the future.

31:57.830 --> 31:58.610
Everything I've done

31:58.610 --> 32:00.040
is for our future.

32:00.510 --> 32:01.910
Everything you've done

32:02.440 --> 32:04.200
is for our future?

32:05.200 --> 32:06.590
Then at this very moment,

32:06.590 --> 32:08.370
I'll act on behalf of my future self

32:08.370 --> 32:09.490
and stop you!

32:22.920 --> 32:23.670
Yixiao,

32:24.270 --> 32:25.680
I hope you never remember

32:25.720 --> 32:27.240
everything that happened that day.

32:27.240 --> 32:28.070
Let all that pain

32:28.070 --> 32:29.140
become the past.

32:29.960 --> 32:30.920
From now on,

32:31.480 --> 32:32.720
I will protect you

32:32.750 --> 32:33.610
with my life.

32:35.400 --> 32:37.720
Are you sure
no one has delivered him messages?

32:37.720 --> 32:38.720
We've been watching everyone

32:38.720 --> 32:40.030
who enters and leaves the pharmacy.

32:40.030 --> 32:40.750
I heard that Prime Minister Zhuang

32:40.750 --> 32:42.160
has recently been gathering support
from senior officials.

32:42.160 --> 32:43.200
He wants to submit

32:43.200 --> 32:43.910
a joint petition at court,

32:43.910 --> 32:44.720
making His Majesty punish you

32:44.720 --> 32:45.750
for your private correspondence

32:45.750 --> 32:46.550
with Jinxiu.

32:46.920 --> 32:48.050
So in my opinion,

32:48.640 --> 32:49.550
Prime Minister Zhuang has not

32:49.550 --> 32:50.880
told Xia Jingshi about this.

32:50.880 --> 32:52.010
Then keep calm

32:52.350 --> 32:53.310
and continue watching.

32:53.310 --> 32:53.720
Yes.

32:55.070 --> 32:56.270
However, Your Highness,

32:56.270 --> 32:57.330
hasn't Miss Yixiao

32:57.550 --> 32:58.830
been staying

32:58.830 --> 33:00.760
with Xia Jingshi for a bit too long?

33:01.240 --> 33:02.900
I-I don't mean anything else.

33:03.440 --> 33:04.720
I just wanted to say,

33:04.880 --> 33:06.160
could Miss Yixiao possibly...

33:06.160 --> 33:07.420
Of course she won't!

33:08.550 --> 33:10.530
Kindness must be repaid;
enemies must be avenged a hundredfold—

33:10.530 --> 33:12.720
that's what the Red-Clad General is like.

33:12.720 --> 33:13.960
If an ordinary person suffered

33:13.960 --> 33:14.960
such injustice,

33:15.440 --> 33:16.640
they would have gone mad

33:16.640 --> 33:18.400
and confronted him with a knife.

33:18.400 --> 33:19.600
But Fu Yixiao

33:19.720 --> 33:20.510
could swallow

33:20.510 --> 33:21.900
all her hatred whole.

33:22.070 --> 33:24.200
She knows exactly what she needs to do.

33:24.550 --> 33:26.360
Her composure and decisiveness

33:26.640 --> 33:29.640
are probably beyond even
what you guys are capable of.

33:30.720 --> 33:31.270
Only a fool

33:31.270 --> 33:33.300
like Xia Jingshi

33:33.880 --> 33:35.550
would fail to cherish her.

33:39.680 --> 33:40.310
What?

33:40.790 --> 33:43.240
Are you upset that
I said a few good things about her?

33:43.240 --> 33:43.920
Not at all.

33:44.590 --> 33:47.830
I'll just learn from her strengths
to improve my weaknesses.

33:47.830 --> 33:48.830
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

33:48.830 --> 33:49.830
I will be humble

33:49.850 --> 33:51.270
and seek guidance from Miss Yixiao,

33:51.270 --> 33:52.070
striving to impress you

33:52.070 --> 33:53.800
one day as well, Your Highness.

34:01.750 --> 34:02.810
Why is Zhengnian Hall suddenly

34:02.810 --> 34:04.470
filled with so many patients?

34:04.550 --> 34:05.400
I heard

34:05.480 --> 34:07.150
there's a real estate broker

34:07.240 --> 34:08.280
who's been boasting around

34:08.280 --> 34:10.030
that he knows the Young Mistress
of Zhengnian Villa.

34:10.030 --> 34:10.400
These days,

34:10.400 --> 34:12.480
many people have come because of that.

34:12.480 --> 34:13.610
I'll get to work now.

34:30.420 --> 34:32.460
[Zhengnian Hall]

34:40.780 --> 34:41.780
Miss Yixiao.

34:45.139 --> 34:46.400
Where is His Highness?

34:46.860 --> 34:47.650
Please get in the carriage.

34:47.650 --> 34:49.510
His Highness is not far from here.

35:18.920 --> 35:20.250
What do you want from me?

35:20.930 --> 35:22.950
This tea is a tribute from the South.

35:23.120 --> 35:24.230
The water used for brewing

35:24.230 --> 35:25.170
is plum-blossom snowwater

35:25.170 --> 35:26.750
collected last December,

35:26.940 --> 35:28.870
freshly taken from the ice cellar.

35:33.950 --> 35:34.960
Such fine tea

35:34.980 --> 35:36.430
gulped down by you like that

35:36.430 --> 35:38.090
is truly a waste of treasure.

35:38.710 --> 35:39.970
What do you want to ask?

35:43.550 --> 35:44.210
Yesterday,

35:45.180 --> 35:46.510
did you learn anything?

35:47.440 --> 35:47.960
No.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.360
You spent a whole night

35:51.360 --> 35:52.630
with Xia Jingshi.

35:52.660 --> 35:54.660
How could you have learned nothing?

35:54.690 --> 35:56.750
What nonsense are you talking about?

35:57.590 --> 35:58.910
Right, you didn't spend
the night together.

35:58.910 --> 36:00.230
You merely spent one night

36:00.230 --> 36:01.650
under the same roof.

36:02.590 --> 36:04.080
Yet you learned nothing?

36:04.710 --> 36:05.630
Were you simply

36:05.630 --> 36:07.500
lost in pleasure?

36:07.800 --> 36:08.920
When did you know?

36:10.550 --> 36:11.110
What?

36:11.400 --> 36:12.530
When did you know

36:13.000 --> 36:15.000
that Xia Jingshi was the one who shot me?

36:15.000 --> 36:16.360
Your previous efforts to stop me

36:16.360 --> 36:18.690
were probably for this reason too, right?

36:19.330 --> 36:20.790
So you already know.

36:21.440 --> 36:22.170
Don't worry.

36:22.440 --> 36:24.000
I didn't learn it much earlier than you.

36:24.000 --> 36:25.480
I just never had the chance

36:25.510 --> 36:26.360
to tell you.

36:26.590 --> 36:28.130
I have no reason to hide this from you.

36:28.130 --> 36:29.700
I'd prefer you knew sooner

36:30.000 --> 36:32.260
so I could enjoy watching your reaction.

36:32.670 --> 36:33.190
You really are

36:33.190 --> 36:34.800
incapable of saying anything nice.

36:34.800 --> 36:35.690
Tell me,

36:36.400 --> 36:37.670
since you were

36:37.710 --> 36:39.480
Xia Jingshi's most trusted general

36:39.480 --> 36:41.480
and a hero in the Battle of Pingling,

36:41.710 --> 36:43.200
why did he want to kill you?

36:43.630 --> 36:45.040
I didn't expect you
to care so much about me.

36:45.040 --> 36:46.340
I'd like to know too.

36:46.670 --> 36:48.190
Why don't you ask him yourself?

36:48.190 --> 36:50.400
I'm guessing you discovered something,

36:50.400 --> 36:52.480
something you weren't supposed to know.

36:52.480 --> 36:54.090
He must have been forced

36:54.150 --> 36:56.700
to take such drastic action against you.

36:59.290 --> 37:00.190
Since you're a partner

37:00.190 --> 37:01.440
I can trust,

37:01.830 --> 37:03.240
I might as well tell you.

37:03.590 --> 37:04.590
The day before Susha attacked

37:04.590 --> 37:05.890
Pingling City,

37:06.150 --> 37:07.510
Xia Jingshi suddenly changed

37:07.510 --> 37:08.440
his battle plan.

37:08.530 --> 37:09.990
Before changing the plan,

37:10.110 --> 37:11.950
he received a secret military report.

37:11.950 --> 37:13.400
Didn't you say before

37:13.800 --> 37:15.720
that someone in Susha
was colluding with the enemy?

37:15.720 --> 37:17.510
It must've been around that time.

37:17.510 --> 37:18.280
Very well.

37:18.450 --> 37:20.710
I'll go investigate the military report.

37:20.710 --> 37:22.290
The night the Battle of Pingling ended,

37:22.290 --> 37:23.150
a merchant

37:23.150 --> 37:24.960
met with Xia Jingshi in his tent.

37:25.220 --> 37:26.030
I should have been

37:26.030 --> 37:27.090
in the tent as well.

37:27.510 --> 37:28.150
However,

37:28.230 --> 37:28.880
as for what they discussed,

37:28.880 --> 37:29.940
I cannot remember.

37:30.440 --> 37:31.330
But I suspect

37:31.630 --> 37:32.840
that what that merchant discussed

37:32.840 --> 37:33.770
with Xia Jingshi

37:33.840 --> 37:36.240
was exactly the reason
he wanted to kill me.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.820
Don't look at me like that.

37:40.380 --> 37:42.170
I'm not hiding anything from you.

37:42.170 --> 37:43.030
I truly don't remember

37:43.030 --> 37:44.090
who that person was

37:44.230 --> 37:45.900
or what they discussed.

37:46.180 --> 37:48.040
I'm staying by Xia Jingshi's side

37:48.090 --> 37:49.550
just to uncover the truth.

37:50.030 --> 37:50.900
As you know,

37:50.930 --> 37:52.790
forcing a confession won't work.

37:52.840 --> 37:53.590
And Xia Jingshi

37:53.590 --> 37:54.880
definitely won't say anything.

37:54.880 --> 37:55.540
So,

37:56.230 --> 37:57.110
this might be our

37:57.110 --> 37:58.150
only chance.

38:00.680 --> 38:02.010
Stay safe.

38:02.400 --> 38:04.000
I'll have people protect you from afar.

38:04.000 --> 38:05.400
That won't be necessary.

38:05.630 --> 38:06.750
I'm telling you all this

38:06.750 --> 38:08.230
because I want you to know that

38:08.230 --> 38:09.850
since I've agreed to cooperate with you,

38:09.850 --> 38:11.360
I absolutely won't go back on my word.

38:11.360 --> 38:12.070
Whatever I should do,

38:12.070 --> 38:13.320
I'll definitely see it through.

38:13.320 --> 38:13.800
As for you...

38:13.800 --> 38:15.660
I'll also do what needs to be done.

38:15.960 --> 38:16.690
That's good.

38:17.440 --> 38:18.670
I can't stay out too long.

38:18.670 --> 38:20.110
Xia Jingshi will get suspicious.

38:20.110 --> 38:20.650
Wait.

38:25.740 --> 38:26.800
Take this with you.

38:28.480 --> 38:29.290
What's this?

38:30.640 --> 38:32.740
It's my heart of mercy.

38:36.480 --> 38:37.040
Yun Fang!

38:37.650 --> 38:38.580
Escort her back.

38:38.710 --> 38:39.400
No need.

38:39.630 --> 38:40.430
For safety's sake,

38:40.430 --> 38:41.080
for the next few days,

38:41.080 --> 38:42.810
you'd better not come to see me.

38:53.460 --> 38:54.280
Your Highness.

38:54.280 --> 38:55.410
Why do I feel

38:55.550 --> 38:57.120
you care quite a lot about

38:58.130 --> 38:59.180
Miss Yixiao?

39:00.470 --> 39:02.110
I care about her?

39:05.270 --> 39:06.730
So what if I care about her?

39:06.840 --> 39:08.280
She's a member of my household.

39:08.280 --> 39:09.810
Shouldn't I care about her?

39:12.970 --> 39:13.830
Your Highness,

39:16.010 --> 39:17.410
His Majesty summons you.

39:23.150 --> 39:24.060
Miss. Miss.

39:24.150 --> 39:24.960
What's wrong?
Where are you feeling unwell?

39:24.960 --> 39:26.220
My throat hurts badly.

39:28.780 --> 39:31.750
[Zhengnian Hall]

39:29.830 --> 39:30.740
Take it easy.

39:31.150 --> 39:32.210
This way, this way.

39:36.560 --> 39:37.420
Your Highness.

39:38.650 --> 39:40.810
The carriage sent by the inn has arrived.

39:40.810 --> 39:41.740
Where is Yixiao?

39:42.440 --> 39:44.700
I only heard someone was looking for her.

39:45.070 --> 39:45.960
In Yujing City,

39:45.980 --> 39:47.070
she has no family or friends.

39:47.070 --> 39:48.470
Who would want to see her?

39:52.840 --> 39:53.700
Your Highness.

39:54.280 --> 39:55.480
There're many patients
at the clinic today,

39:55.480 --> 39:56.880
and we're really short-staffed,

39:56.880 --> 39:58.090
so I sent Yixiao to the medicine merchant

39:58.090 --> 39:59.550
to fetch some herbs for me.

40:01.140 --> 40:02.430
Then please, Miss Ling,

40:02.430 --> 40:04.160
tell Yixiao when she comes back

40:04.480 --> 40:06.080
to take good care of herself.

40:07.360 --> 40:08.490
Thank you for taking care of me

40:08.490 --> 40:10.220
these past few days, Miss Ling.

40:10.270 --> 40:11.210
Your Highness is too kind.

40:11.210 --> 40:13.140
It's simply my duty as a physician.

40:17.200 --> 40:18.460
I'll take my leave now.

40:38.190 --> 40:40.870
His Majesty has arrived!

40:44.550 --> 40:46.710
Greetings, Your Majesty!

40:49.360 --> 40:50.440
You may rise.

40:50.960 --> 40:52.670
Thank you, Your Majesty.

40:57.090 --> 40:58.470
Censor Wang.

41:00.710 --> 41:01.760
Yes, Your Majesty.

41:01.760 --> 41:03.440
In your Censorate,

41:03.480 --> 41:05.170
excluding those on official leave, sick,

41:05.170 --> 41:06.030
or in mourning,

41:07.070 --> 41:09.130
how many people remain in the office?

41:09.360 --> 41:10.340
Your Majesty.

41:10.630 --> 41:11.690
The Censorate

41:11.880 --> 41:14.140
has 12 officials of fifth rank or higher.

41:14.590 --> 41:16.480
Excluding two
who cannot perform their duties,

41:16.480 --> 41:18.060
there are 10 working daily.

41:20.070 --> 41:20.930
10 people, huh?

41:21.800 --> 41:22.640
Do you know

41:22.670 --> 41:24.440
how many memorials I've received

41:24.440 --> 41:26.550
in just a few hours?

41:32.400 --> 41:33.660
18!

41:35.400 --> 41:36.510
10 people from the Censorate

41:36.510 --> 41:38.630
submitted 18 memorials to me.

41:38.920 --> 41:39.920
Is your Censorate

41:39.960 --> 41:42.160
so idle that you have nothing else to do?

41:45.310 --> 41:46.980
Stop exchanging glances!

41:48.590 --> 41:51.110
Since you cannot answer, Censor Wang,

41:52.190 --> 41:53.630
I presume Prime Minister Zhuang,

41:53.630 --> 41:55.290
you can explain this clearly?

41:57.960 --> 41:58.710
Your Majesty,

41:58.710 --> 42:00.960
I've heard something about this matter.

42:00.960 --> 42:02.480
It was all because the First Prince

42:02.480 --> 42:05.280
privately wrote a letter
to the Emperor of Jinxiu.

42:05.360 --> 42:07.550
This action is absurdly inappropriate

42:07.550 --> 42:09.600
and unbecoming of a prince.

42:09.750 --> 42:11.550
The court officials are indignant

42:11.550 --> 42:12.550
and have submitted numerous memorials

42:12.550 --> 42:14.320
impeaching the First Prince.

42:16.550 --> 42:19.110
His Highness the First Prince has arrived!

42:38.400 --> 42:39.150
I

42:40.480 --> 42:42.280
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

42:42.550 --> 42:43.360
Rise.

42:46.630 --> 42:47.970
I summoned you here

42:48.480 --> 42:50.520
so you could hear for yourself

42:50.630 --> 42:51.630
how these people

42:51.710 --> 42:53.030
are impeaching you.

42:57.320 --> 42:58.120
Your Majesty.

42:58.340 --> 43:00.290
As Your Majesty's eldest son,

43:00.310 --> 43:03.000
the First Prince should
set an example for all officials.

43:03.000 --> 43:04.330
Such rash actions

43:04.440 --> 43:05.920
offend royal dignity.

43:05.940 --> 43:07.960
This matter must be strictly investigated
and punished;

43:07.960 --> 43:10.190
otherwise, the people will not accept it,

43:10.190 --> 43:12.040
nor will us court officials.
